  m_text: 'Healing (Hold for 3 seconds while not moving or healing) - Q


    Movement
    - WASD or Arrow Keys


    Change Weapon - E


    Reload - R


    Sprint -
    Shift


    Shoot - Left Click


    Aim Down Sight - Right Click or Control


    Jump
    - Space


    Dash - Space while in air (prevents fall damage)


    Building
    - Z for wall, X for floor, C for ramp, V for break by default, can be changed
    in settings


    Unlock cursor - Escape

